OL,3,GNEWSAClean-up of illegal waste
OL,4,Asupersite costs taxpayers #6m
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government, which launched a
OL,7,Fcrackdown on waste crime last week,
OL,8,Fsaid it would do more to force
OL,9,Fcriminals to pay for clean-up
OL,10,Foperations by confiscating their money
OL,11,Fand assets.
